Vacaturebeschrijving
   Build your career as a Class C Truck Driver while maintaining a healthy work-life balance. Whether you are an experienced driver or just starting out, this is your opportunity to develop your skills and gain valuable experience on the road.About the companyYou will join an informal and close-knit working environment where teamwork and job satisfaction are highly valued. Working day shifts means you can enjoy your evenings at home, while customers regularly show their appreciation for your hard work with a drink or something to eat.  Functieomschrijving:
 This is what you will do as a Truckdriver As a Class C Truck Driver, you make sure customers receive their orders safely and on time. You will have your own truck and route, allowing you to build strong relationships with your regular customers.- You will deliver orders safely and on time to regular customers;
- You will load, transport and unload products;
- You will drive your own route with your own truck and driver's mate;
- You will maintain daily contact with customers and their staff;
- You will handle transport administration and coordinate with the planning;
- You will start between 5:30 and 7:00 AM and finish in time for dinner.


  Functievereisten:
 This is what you will do as a Truckdriver- You hold a valid Category C driving licence and Code 95;
- You are willing to further develop your skills as a professional driver;
- You enjoy physical work and do not mind being active throughout the day;
- You are sociable and enjoy building relationships with customers;
- You speak either Dutch or English.


  Arbeidsvoorwaarden:
 This is what you get as a Truckdriver - You can earn a salary of up to €3,500 gross per month;
- You will have the prospect of a permanent contract;
- You will have opportunities for training and career progression;
- You will receive a pension plan through STIPP from your first working day;
- You will receive 8% holiday allowance;
